+        "Track B: on the generated Theorem 3.5/Proposition 4.2 zero-slice regime, "
+        "the aggregate-slices decoder runs in O(m*n^2) exact arithmetic; shipping "
+        "measurements are filled from selftest_report.json, while the cancellation "
