The replacement also timed out and, because the harness’s redraw set still permits the original vendor when no call has completed, it selected `x-ai/grok-4.6` again. Both rows remain unscored API errors. I’ll allow the built-in retry cap to decide whether the pool is reachable.
diff --git a/gen_2604_17061.py b/gen_2604_17061.py
